---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="Intelligent Stethoscope" description="A wireless stethoscope and heart-sound visualization prototype by Qinyu Luo." active="projects">
  <div class="container stethoscope-page">
    <a href="/projects/" class="back-link">← All projects</a>
    <header class="prototype-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Healthcare · Hardware prototype</p><h1>Listening,<br /><em>made visible.</em></h1><p class="prototype-deck">A wireless stethoscope and a companion interface for exploring heart sounds.</p><div class="prototype-meta"><span>Intelligent Stethoscope</span><span>Independent prototype</span><span>Started in 2020</span></div></header>
    <figure class="prototype-hero"><img src="/images/product/stethoscope1.jpg" alt="A 3D design rendering of the wireless stethoscope" width="2388" height="1475" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption><span>01 / The prototype</span><span>Device design study</span></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="prototype-story"><aside><p class="meta-label">The starting point</p><p class="aside-note">A practical question<br />during the pandemic.</p></aside><section class="story-copy" aria-labelledby="motivation-title"><h2 id="motivation-title">What if listening didn’t<br />require a wire?</h2><p>In 2020, watching my father work on the front lines of the COVID-19 pandemic brought a practical problem into focus: conventional stethoscopes are difficult to use while wearing protective equipment.</p><p>That observation led me to build a wireless stethoscope prototype. I wanted to explore a connected workflow for capturing heart sounds and making those recordings easier to see and review.</p></section></div>
    <div class="prototype-photos"><figure><img src="/images/product/stethoscope2.jpg" alt="A side view of the wireless stethoscope design" width="2326" height="1174" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>02 / Side view of the device design</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/product/stethoscope3.jpg" alt="A close-up rendering of the stethoscope listening surface" width="2388" height="1478" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>03 / A closer look at the listening surface</figcaption></figure></div>
    <div class="prototype-story sound-story"><aside><p class="meta-label">From sound to signal</p><p class="aside-note">A closer look<br />at each heartbeat.</p></aside><section class="story-copy" aria-labelledby="visualization-title"><h2 id="visualization-title">A visual companion<br />to listening.</h2><p>The companion interface displays captured heart sounds as waveforms. Viewing the signal over time offers another way to explore the rhythm and structure of a recording alongside the audio itself.</p><p>This work is a hardware and visualization prototype. It documents an exploration of wireless listening and signal presentation; it does not establish clinical diagnostic performance.</p></section></div>
    <div class="signal-gallery"><figure><img src="/images/product/waveform.png" alt="A heart-sound waveform displayed over time in the prototype interface" width="1647" height="191" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Heart-sound signal shown as a waveform.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/product/waveform%202.png" alt="An expanded waveform view of a recorded heart-sound signal" width="2356" height="372" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>A closer view of the captured recording.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/product/waveform%203.png" alt="An additional signal visualization from the stethoscope prototype" width="2348" height="432" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Exploring ways to present the signal.</figcaption></figure></div>
    <section class="prototype-end" aria-labelledby="next-title"><p class="eyebrow">An ongoing interest</p><h2 id="next-title">Technology, closer to people.</h2><p>This project continues to shape my interest in intelligent healthcare and in tools that connect useful computation with everyday needs.</p><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`} data-contact-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="contact-dialog">Discuss the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  .stethoscope-page{padding-top:3rem;padding-bottom:6rem}.prototype-heading{margin:3.5rem 0 2.5rem}.prototype-heading h1{font-family:var(--font-serif,'Newsreader Variable',Georgia,serif);font-size:clamp(3.7rem,7vw,6.5rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:.95;margin:1.3rem 0 1.6rem}.prototype-heading h1 em{color:var(--accent,#b34d38);font-weight:400}.prototype-deck{font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted,#73736a);max-width:530px}.prototype-meta{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2.4rem;font-size:.65rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}.prototype-meta>span+span{border-left:1px solid var(--line,#deddd5);padding-left:1.5rem}.prototype-hero{margin:0}.prototype-hero img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:650px;object-fit:cover}.prototype-hero figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font-size:.65rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#deddd5)}.prototype-story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.1fr;gap:4rem;margin:5rem 0}.prototype-story aside{padding-top:.3rem}.prototype-story .meta-label{font-size:.66rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent,#b34d38);margin:0 0 1.2rem}.aside-note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);line-height:1.8}.story-copy h2{font-family:var(--font-serif,'Newsreader Variable',Georgia,serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.5vw,3rem);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 1.6rem}.story-copy p{font-size:.94rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);line-height:1.9;max-width:650px;margin:0 0 1rem}.prototype-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem}.prototype-photos figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.prototype-photos img{display:block;width:100%;height:300px;object-fit:cover}.prototype-photos figcaption{font-size:.63rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);margin-top:.85rem;line-height:1.6}.signal-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem}.signal-gallery figure{margin:0;min-width:0;padding:1.2rem;background:#f0efe9;border:1px solid var(--line,#deddd5);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.signal-gallery figure:first-child{grid-column:1/-1;padding:1.6rem}.signal-gallery img{display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.signal-gallery figcaption{font-size:.64rem;color:var(--muted,#73736a);margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.6}.prototype-end{margin-top:5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#deddd5);padding-top:3rem;max-width:800px}.prototype-end h2{font-family:var(--font-serif,'Newsreader Variable',Georgia,serif);font-weight:400;font-size:2.8rem;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.1;margin:1rem 0}.prototype-end>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted,#73736a);max-width:650px}.prototype-end>a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--accent,#b34d38);text-decoration:none}.prototype-end>a>span{padding-left:.4rem}@media(max-width:750px){.stethoscope-page{padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem}.prototype-heading{margin-top:2.5rem}.prototype-heading h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,11vw,5rem)}.prototype-meta{gap:.7rem 1rem;line-height:1.6}.prototype-meta>span+span{padding-left:1rem}.prototype-story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.2rem;margin:3rem 0}.prototype-story .aside-note{display:none}.prototype-story .meta-label{margin-bottom:0}.story-copy h2{font-size:2.3rem}.prototype-photos{gap:1rem}.prototype-photos img{height:220px}.signal-gallery{gap:1rem}.signal-gallery figure{padding:.7rem}.signal-gallery figure:first-child{padding:1rem}.prototype-end{margin-top:3rem;padding-top:2rem}.prototype-end h2{font-size:2.2rem}}@media(max-width:480px){.prototype-deck{font-size:1rem}.prototype-meta{font-size:.58rem}.prototype-meta>span+span{border:0;padding-left:0}.prototype-hero figcaption{font-size:.58rem;line-height:1.6}.prototype-hero figcaption>span:first-child{white-space:nowrap}.prototype-photos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.prototype-photos img{height:auto}.signal-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}.signal-gallery figure:first-child{grid-column:auto}.story-copy p{font-size:.88rem}}
</style>
